tripal_chado/chado_schema/default_schema-1.31/default_schema-1.31-views.sql:693:-- The standard Chado pattern for protein coding genes
tripal_chado/chado_schema/default_schema-1.31/default_schema-1.31-views.sql:694:-- is a feature of type 'gene' with 'mRNA' features as parts
