tripal_chado/chado_schema/schema-definition/version-1.3.3.011.yml:3970:  description: "The geo-referencable location of the stock. NOTE: This entity is subject to change as a more general and possibly more OpenGIS-compliant geolocation module may be introduced into Chado."
